---
import ProfileLinks from '../components/ProfileLinks.astro';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page title="About">
  <div slot="intro" class="portrait-layout">
    <img class="portrait" src="/images/aurora-constantin.jpg" alt="Dr. Aurora Constantin" width="200" height="200" />
    <div class="identity">
      <h1>Dr. Aurora Constantin</h1>
      <p class="affiliation"><a href="https://people.inf.ed.ac.uk/Aurora_Constantin.html">Lecturer, School of Informatics</a> · University of Edinburgh</p>
      <p class="bio">My research in human–computer interaction brings together education, assistive technology and digital accessibility. I work on technology for autism, participatory and distributed design, multimodal interaction and applied AI.</p>
      <ProfileLinks />
      <address>
        Room 4.18C, Informatics Forum, 10 Crichton Street, Edinburgh EH8 9AB<br />
        <a href="mailto:aurora.constantin@ed.ac.uk">aurora.constantin@ed.ac.uk</a><br />
        <a href="tel:+441316515643">+44 (0)131 651 5643</a>
      </address>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="profile-details">
    <section class="record supervision">
      <div>
        <h2>Student Supervision</h2>
        <p>I supervise and co-supervise <a href="https://sites.google.com/site/auroraconstantin/student-projects">student projects</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="phd-note" aria-label="PhD enquiries">
        <p>Thinking about a PhD in digital accessibility, participatory design or educational and assistive technologies? I’d be happy to hear about your ideas.</p>
        <a class="apply-button" href="https://www.ed.ac.uk/studying/postgraduate/degrees/index.php?r=site/view&amp;edition=2023&amp;id=494">PhD Application Information</a>
      </aside>
    </section>
    <section class="record">
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <ul class="dated">
        <li><strong>2015</strong><span>PhD in Informatics, University of Edinburgh, UK</span></li>
        <li><strong>2009</strong><span>MSc in IT, University of Glasgow, UK</span></li>
        <li><strong>2000</strong><span>PhD in Physics, University of Craiova, Romania</span></li>
        <li><strong>1986</strong><span>BSc in Physics, University of Craiova, Romania</span></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section class="record">
      <h2>Awards and Professional Activities</h2>
      <ul class="dated">
        <li><strong>2024</strong><span>Elected to a three-year term on the University of Edinburgh Senate.</span></li>
        <li><strong>2023</strong><span>Senior Fellow of the Higher Education Academy.</span></li>
        <li><strong>2022</strong><span>Awarded a knighthood in Romania’s National Order of Cultural Merit, Section H (scientific research). <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xf5MkgfW2iQ">Watch the ceremony and my speech</a>.</span></li>
        <li><strong>2019</strong><span>Fellow of the Higher Education Academy.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section class="record">
      <h2>Roles</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Member of the <a href="https://www.inf.ed.ac.uk/research/aiai/">Artificial Intelligence and its Applications Institute</a>.</li>
        <li>Coordinator of training for tutors and demonstrators.</li>
        <li>Lead for the Visiting Undergraduate (VUG) cohort.</li>
        <li>Coordinator of incoming internships and exchanges.</li>
        <li>Lead of the Accessibility and Inclusivity Working Group.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section class="record">
      <h2>Memberships</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Since 2025 · Champions of Accessibility Network</li>
        <li>Since 2019 · University of Edinburgh Disabled Staff Network</li>
        <li>Since 2019 · Scottish Parliament <a href="https://www.parliament.scot/msps/autism.aspx">Cross-Party Group on Autism</a></li>
        <li>Since 2018 · School of Informatics <a href="https://web.inf.ed.ac.uk/infweb/admin/committees/equality-and-diversity-committee">Equality and Diversity Committee</a></li>
        <li>Since 2017 · Scottish Parliament <a href="https://www.parliament.scot/msps/disability.aspx">Cross-Party Group on Disability</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</Page>

<style>
  .apply-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: .6rem 1rem;
    border-radius: .6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .apply-button:hover, .apply-button:focus-visible { text-decoration: underline; }
  .identity p { max-width: 64ch; }
  address { margin-top: 1rem; font-size: .95rem; font-style: normal; color: #47585b; }
  .portrait-layout, .record {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #263e4312;
    border-radius: 1.35rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 4px #18373d08, 0 9px 24px -10px #18373d35;
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
  }
  .profile-details {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.8rem);
  }
  .record { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .record h2 { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .record ul, .record p { margin-block: 0; }
  .supervision {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.5fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .phd-note { border-inline-start: 3px solid var(--accent); padding-inline-start: 1.25rem; }
  .phd-note p { max-width: 62ch; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  li + li { margin-top: .55rem; }
  .dated { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .dated li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3.5rem 1fr; gap: .5rem; }
  .dated strong { color: var(--accent); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  @media (max-width: 44rem) {
    .profile-details, .supervision { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
